Date: Tue, 10 Mar 2026 21:30:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] use python script for therock instead of sh bat

Combine rcb_pre_config, rcb_config and rcb_build
bat and sh files to python scripts so that same
file can be used both on linux and windows.

Signed-off-by: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
